  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/12/MarchaSenderistaAyodarPeñaSaganta.jpeg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El parque natural Sierra Espad&aacute;n ha organizado este domingo una salida senderista desde Ay&oacute;dar a Pe&ntilde;a Saganta, en Espadilla, con motivo del D&iacute;a Mundial de las Monta&ntilde;as, que se celebra este lunes, 11 de diciembre.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidasenderistaayodar/img_1409.jpg\" alt=\"img_1409\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidasenderistaayodar/img_1410.jpg\" alt=\"img_1410\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidasenderistaayodar/img_1412.jpg\" alt=\"img_1412\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidasenderistaayodar/img_1416.jpg\" alt=\"img_1416\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidasenderistaayodar/img_1418.jpg\" alt=\"img_1418\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidasenderistaayodar/img_1419.jpg\" alt=\"img_1419\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidasenderistaayodar/img_1420.jpg\" alt=\"img_1420\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidasenderistaayodar/img_1422.jpg\" alt=\"img_1422\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/eixidasenderistaayodar/img_1423.jpg\" alt=\"img_1423\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715